  "decisions": [
    "Scope: the 13 dev/design skill files and docs/.og/cli.mjs changed by the five /evolve adoptions of 2026-11-14 (commits 9d671ac, c790df4, 68da989); CLAUDE.md is a structure-only root file and is not harvested.",
    "Every deployed_sha256 in state equalled the pre-adoption hash of its live file, so the promoted delta is exactly the adopted hunks; no earlier unharvested edits were mixed in.",
    "Generalization: `.claude/skills/` -> `{{provider:skills_root}}/`, `/dev ceremony` -> `{{provider:invoke:dev}} ceremony`, `/design ceremony` -> `{{provider:invoke:design}} ceremony`, `{stories root}` -> `{{DESIGN_STORIES_ROOT}}`; Claude-specific `TaskList` wording replaced by 'the native tracker'. No new placeholder names introduced.",
    "docs/.og/cli.mjs: canonical copy was edited directly and identically to the live file (prettier-formatted in the same commit); bundled as an update from its recorded checkpoint 2badf4ef\u2026 and recorded as a harvest observation, no canonical write needed.",
    "dev/runtime/planning.md stays installed and canonical (shared adaptor file); only dev's reference to it is removed.",
    "Versions: dev TEMPLATE 3.1.0 -> 3.2.0, design TEMPLATE 6.1.0 -> 6.2.0 (compatible new behavior), package 3.3.0 -> 3.4.0; CHANGELOG 3.4.0 entry added.",
    "Deployment baselines (deployed_sha256 / rendered_base) are not advanced by harvest, per the state contract; the live files already carry the behavior with placeholders rendered."
  ],
